{"the_ratio_of_the_correctly_classified_elements_over_all_available_elements": "The ratio of the correctly classified elements over all available elements is a specific mathematical formulation used to calculate accuracy. This ratio provides a quantitative measure of how many elements were correctly identified by the model out of the total number of elements present in the dataset, thus offering a clear indication of the model's classification performance."},
