{"similar_information": "\"Similar information\" refers to the data or insights that are commonly obtained or represented by both the JI and BF metrics. In the given context, it indicates that these two metrics, when compared to the BJ score, tend to provide overlapping or analogous insights about the score distributions being evaluated."},
