{"13__addressed__initial_exploration_of_adding_geometric_information_besides_color": "The predicate \"addressed\" indicates that the subject [13] dealt with or considered a particular issue or topic. In this context, it means that the research or study [13] took on the challenge of incorporating additional types of information into image processing beyond just color data."},
{"initial_exploration_of_adding_geometric_information_besides_color": "The object \"initial exploration of adding geometric information besides color\" refers to the specific focus of the research or study [13]. This exploration involved experimenting with the inclusion of geometric data, such as depth images, in addition to color information, to see how it might improve the accuracy or effectiveness of image analysis techniques."},
