{"classwise_metrics": "Classwise metrics refer to the evaluation metrics that are calculated for each class individually in semantic segmentation tasks. They provide a more detailed and class-specific assessment compared to global metrics, which aggregate performance across all classes.|Here is another description: Classwise metrics refer to the evaluation of segmentation accuracy for each individual class in a segmentation task, as opposed to global metrics which consider the overall performance across all classes. They are particularly useful in scenarios where different classes have varying levels of importance or frequency of appearance."},
