{"3846_observations": "The 3846 observations represent the individual data points or instances within the training dataset. These observations are selected from various parts of the 5 virtual scenarios in the Virtual Kitti dataset, ensuring a diverse range of conditions and sequences are included in the training process.|Here is another description: The 3846 observations refer to a specific set of data points selected for training purposes within the Virtual Kitti dataset. These observations are integral to the training process of various models, ensuring that the models are exposed to a diverse range of scenarios and conditions."},
{"3846_observations__are_chosen_along__different_parts_of_the_5_scenarios": "The phrase \"are chosen along\" indicates the method by which the 3846 observations were selected. This selection process involved distributing the observations across various parts of the dataset to ensure comprehensive coverage of the different scenarios and conditions present."},
{"different_parts_of_the_5_scenarios": "The different parts of the 5 scenarios refer to the various segments and conditions within the Virtual Kitti dataset. These scenarios include different illumination and weather conditions such as clone, fog, morning, overcast, rain, and sunset, which were simulated to resemble real-world environments."},
