{"1266_images": "The object \"1266 images\" describes the exact number of images that constitute the test data. These images are selected from different sections of the Virtual Kitti dataset and are used to evaluate the models' performance across different scenarios and conditions.|Here is another description: The 1266 images represent a subset of the total dataset used for testing the performance of various models and input data combinations in semantic segmentation tasks. These images are crucial for evaluating the accuracy and effectiveness of different approaches."},
