{"high_accuracy_rates": "\"High accuracy rates\" refer to the exceptional level of precision or correctness achieved in the dataset, likely in the context of data analysis or machine learning tasks.|Here is another description: High accuracy rates refer to the exceptional levels of precision and correctness obtained in a particular process or system."},
