{"different_accuracy_metrics": "Different accuracy metrics refer to various methods or criteria used to evaluate the performance of models, particularly in the context of machine learning and data analysis. These metrics can include measures like precision, recall, F1 score, and others, each providing a unique perspective on model accuracy."},
