{"large_variability_even_for_similar_models": "Large variability even for similar models indicates that the performance metrics for low frequency classes can differ significantly, even when evaluated using models that are ostensibly similar in design or architecture. This suggests that small changes or differences in model configuration can lead to notably different outcomes in accuracy for these classes."},
