{"we__compute__the_perimage_score_on_the_segmented_test_sequence_of_virtual_kitti_rgb_nd_obtained_with_the_model_cedcnn2": "The predicate 'compute' indicates the action taken by the subject to calculate or determine a specific value or metric. In this context, it involves calculating the perimage score, which is a measure of performance or quality for each segmented image in a test sequence."},
{"the_perimage_score_on_the_segmented_test_sequence_of_virtual_kitti_rgb_nd_obtained_with_the_model_cedcnn2": "The object describes the specific task or result of the computation. Here, it is the perimage score on the segmented test sequence of Virtual KITTI (RGB-ND) obtained with the model CEDCNN2. This score is a quantitative measure of how well the CEDCNN2 model performed on each image in the test sequence of the Virtual KITTI dataset, which includes RGB and near-infrared (ND) data."},
